---
// spec: S29 /how-to-order (static), F25-AC1 ("GVS niji academy hai"), F25-AC4 (4 qadam, payment, refund ka link, HowTo schema),
//       F25-AC5 + intent 13/15.3 (ad nahin), intent 9.2–9.5 (order, payment, track), 9.10 (refund ka link).
//       Payment ke numbers page par likhe nahin: order ke baad track page / WhatsApp par (purana ya jaali number na chale).
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import WorkHours from '../components/WorkHours.astro';
import seo from '../data/seo.json';
import { ORDER_STEPS } from '../lib/order-steps';
import { howToSchema, jsonLd } from '../lib/schema-ld';
import { PUBLIC_WHATSAPP_FALLBACK } from 'astro:env/client';
import { toDisplay, waLink } from '../lib/phone';

const meta = seo.pages['/how-to-order'];
const url = new URL('/how-to-order', Astro.site ?? Astro.url).href;
const ld = howToSchema({ name: 'GVS Academy se order kaise karein', description: meta.description, url, steps: [...ORDER_STEPS] });
const number = PUBLIC_WHATSAPP_FALLBACK;
---
<Base title={meta.title} description={meta.description}>
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={jsonLd(ld)} />
  <div class="container-page py-6">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Order kaise karein' }]} />
    <h1 class="mt-3">Order kaise karein: 4 asaan qadam</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 max-w-[68ch] text-muted">Na sign up, na password. Order WhatsApp par jata hai aur aap ko order number milta hai jis se aap darja dekh sakte hain.</p>

    <ol class="mt-6 flex max-w-[68ch] flex-col gap-3" data-how-steps>
      {
        ORDER_STEPS.map((s, i) => (
          <li id={`qadam-${i + 1}`} class="flex gap-3 rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface p-4">
            <span class="tabular inline-flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-bold text-on-primary" aria-hidden="true">
              {i + 1}
            </span>
            <span>
              <span class="block font-semibold">{s.t}</span>
              <span class="block text-muted">{s.d}</span>
            </span>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>

    <div class="max-w-[68ch]">
      <section class="mt-8" aria-labelledby="pay-h">
        <h2 id="pay-h">Payment kaise karein</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 flex list-disc flex-col gap-2 pl-5">
          <li>Payment <strong>JazzCash</strong> ya <strong>Easypaisa</strong> se hoti hai.</li>
          <li>Payment ka number aur account ka naam order ke baad <a href="/track">Order track karein</a> wale page par aur hamare WhatsApp par milta hai.</li>
          <li>Payment sirf usi number par karein jo hamare WhatsApp ya track page par likha ho. Kisi aur number se aaya paigham ho to pehle hum se poochh lein.</li>
          <li>Payment ke baad screenshot WhatsApp par bhejein, sath order number likhein (maslan GVS-2611-0001).</li>
          <li>Job apply ya sarkari scheme ke kaam mein <strong>sarkari fee alag</strong> hai; woh official challan par jati hai, hamari fee mein shamil nahin.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8" aria-labelledby="time-h">
        <h2 id="time-h">Kaam kab shuru hota hai</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Waqt payment milne ke baad shuru hota hai. Hum <WorkHours /> kaam karte hain; is ke baad aane wali payment par kaam agle din subah shuru hota hai.
          Har order ka andaza track page par ulti ginti ki shakal mein nazar aata hai. Jis kaam ke liye documents chahiye (maslan job apply), us ka
          waqt documents milne ke baad shuru hota hai.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8" aria-labelledby="track-h">
        <h2 id="track-h">Order ka darja dekhein</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          <a href="/track">Order track karein</a> par apna order number likhein. Wahan darja (Order mila, Payment mil gayi, Kaam jari hai, Mukammal), bacha hua waqt aur
          zaroori hidayat nazar aati hain. Isi browser se kiye gaye orders <a href="/my-history">Meri history</a> mein bhi mehfooz rehte hain.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8" aria-labelledby="refund-h">
        <h2 id="refund-h">Cancel aur refund</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Order cancel karna ho to WhatsApp par likhein. Kab poori raqam wapas hoti hai aur kab nahin, yeh <a href="/terms#refund">refund policy</a> mein saaf likha hai.
        </p>
      </section>

      <p class="mt-8 rounded-lg bg-surface-2 px-4 py-3">
        Koi sawal ho to WhatsApp karein:
        <a href={waLink(number)} class="font-semibold tabular" rel="noopener" data-whatsapp-number>{toDisplay(number)}</a>.
        GVS niji academy hai, sarkari idara nahin.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
